<title>USA: Comp Care unaware of reason for shr moves.</title>
<headline>Comp Care unaware of reason for shr moves.</headline>
<dateline>CORONA DEL MAR, Calif. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comprehensive Care Corp said on Monday it is unaware of any recent developments other than its previous public announcements that would account for the stock to hit a new high.</p>
<p>Comprehensive Care shares closed at 11-1/4, up 3/4, on 151,800 shares of volume after touching a high of 12. The stock's year high was 10-3/4.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange asked the company to comment on the recent activity, Comprehensive Care said.</p>
